{"meta":{"templateCredsSetupCompleted":false},"name":"Turn WhatsApp voice notes and photos from job sites into daily construction reports","nodes":[{"id":"b4b4cd06-8127-4597-96ba-35fdb95ffbaf","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-608,-192],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":896,"content":"## Turn WhatsApp voice notes and photos from job sites into daily construction reports\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow turns incoming WhatsApp job-site updates into structured construction site logs and daily reports. Crew members can send text, voice notes, or photos; the workflow identifies the sender and project, transcribes or describes media with OpenAI, stores the resulting log entry in Google Sheets, and alerts the PM when attention is needed. Each evening, it gathers the day’s log rows, generates project-level report emails, sends them, and archives summary rows for reporting history.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the WhatsApp Business trigger and WhatsApp send/media credentials so incoming messages and media URLs can be accessed.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and set up sheets for crew members, projects, site logs, and daily reports; update the Configuration node values such as sheetUrl.\n- Connect Google Drive credentials and set the photosFolderId used for storing site photos.\n- Connect OpenAI credentials for transcription, photo description, structured site-log extraction, and daily report writing.\n- Connect Gmail credentials and configure officeEmail or recipient fields for PM alerts and daily report delivery.\n- Verify the evening schedule, crew phone-number mappings, project mappings, and PM-attention rules before activating the workflow.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the report schedule, site-log fields, OpenAI prompts/output schemas, photo storage folder, recipient lists, and the conditions that trigger PM alerts."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"a3e9be57-fbae-446a-af93-7a2422ac9a18","name":"Sheet setup","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-608,760],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":520,"content":"## Sheet setup\nCreate one Google Sheet with these tabs and header rows:\n\n**Crew**\n`Name | Phone | Role | Project`\nPhone with country code, e.g. +44 7700 900123\n\n**Projects**\n`Project | Report emails | Active`\nSeparate several emails with commas. Set Active to `no` to stop reports.\n\n**Site log** and **Daily reports**\nLeave them empty with just the tab names; the workflow writes the columns on the first run."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"1ba99d93-78e6-426b-a703-ee76a644da5d","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-48,112],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":352,"content":"## Receive WhatsApp updates\n\nEntry point for job-site messages sent by crew members through WhatsApp."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"8b8fa3c0-9b70-44e2-857b-690e57538e4a","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-48,1248],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":320,"content":"## Start evening reports\n\nScheduled trigger that starts the daily report generation flow at 6pm."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"0e8f7856-477d-49ad-ab2f-706b31bb5ea6","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[208,672],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":336,"content":"## Load shared settings\n\nCentral configuration and trigger router that applies common settings, then sends execution into either the WhatsApp intake branch or the scheduled reporting branch."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"741cb22d-0655-4175-accf-8915796cfe4b","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[672,144],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":640,"height":320,"content":"## Resolve sender context\n\nLooks up crew and project records, then determines who sent the WhatsApp message, which project it belongs to, and what type of message was received."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"c8122a55-c406-4e5d-8e02-771cad12c92d","name":"Sticky Note5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1360,144],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":688,"height":576,"content":"## Validate and route message\n\nChecks whether the sender is registered, routes supported message types into the appropriate media/text handling path, and replies when the sender or message type is not accepted."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"b2edb81d-ad1d-43d6-88d9-1f781fa7707f","name":"Sticky Note6","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1840,-192],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":640,"height":304,"content":"## Transcribe voice notes\n\nFetches the WhatsApp voice note media URL, downloads the audio, and transcribes it with OpenAI so it can be treated as a text update."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"79e301dd-7947-4e40-a7f4-61d63c5a9f78","name":"Sticky Note7","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2080,144],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":848,"height":496,"content":"## Process site photos\n\nDownloads WhatsApp photo media, generates an AI description, saves the image to Google Drive, and combines the description with the stored-photo reference."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"bea257e3-25b6-4b70-becb-728d4a45a56c","name":"Sticky Note8","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2960,144],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":720,"height":528,"content":"## Extract log fields\n\nNormalizes text, voice, or photo inputs into a plain-text update, uses an LLM with a structured parser to extract site-log fields, and flattens the result into a Google Sheets row."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"3c69dfb6-c737-43db-ba35-148cfd0a8aef","name":"Sticky Note9","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3712,16],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":672,"height":560,"content":"## Save log and alert\n\nAppends the structured update to the site log, confirms receipt to the crew member, and emails the PM when the log entry meets the attention criteria."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"3dc11f53-63d2-4c9f-be38-b60849eb86fc","name":"Sticky Note10","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[672,1264],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":848,"height":304,"content":"## Collect report inputs\n\nFor the scheduled branch, retrieves today’s site-log rows and project records, groups updates by project, and checks whether each project has activity to report."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"ba721aba-5650-4a59-b16f-f0ee01e6be73","name":"Sticky Note11","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1568,1104],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":576,"height":624,"content":"## Compose report content\n\nUses an LLM and structured output format to write daily reports for projects with updates, while also building no-update notices for projects without activity."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"350eda81-2102-4349-bc0e-b001035aa956","name":"Sticky Note12","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2192,1136],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":560,"content":"## Send and archive reports\n\nEmails the daily project report or no-update notice, formats a summary row, and appends it to the daily reports sheet for tracking."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"b502acd8-4045-4261-9d90-55422015c7a1","name":"When WhatsApp Message Received","type":"n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger","position":[0,300],"webhookId":"0b9075c0-9fc7-4d0d-8d89-fae8e20c2a56","parameters":{"updates":["messages"]},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"24c11830-ec05-4e0c-aa32-f5f252f68c4a","name":"Every Evening at 6pm","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[0,1400],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"triggerAtHour":18}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"e0160b63-5c87-4bc3-8969-b2eecce73bb6","name":"Set Configuration Parameters","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[260,850],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"20dea54c-9264-462f-8221-41b37ad72d11","name":"companyName","type":"string","value":"Your Construction Co."},{"id":"ca1edf3b-25b8-4a99-ba67-55c50bc3e497","name":"sheetUrl","type":"string","value":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit"},{"id":"8adba079-19c6-4896-b908-8fabcfe9ec3c","name":"photosFolderId","type":"string","value":"YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID"},{"id":"040b9017-cd51-4be6-a2ea-4ab23bda3145","name":"officeEmail","type":"string","value":"user@example.com"},{"id":"c8964775-9b21-49f8-9ccc-1cbce1e05a7f","name":"reportLanguage","type":"string","value":"English"}]},"includeOtherFields":true},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"d341676e-c4c8-4792-8644-2e6f1f9a055c","name":"Route by Trigger Event","type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","position":[480,850],"parameters":{"rules":{"values":[{"outputKey":"Site message","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"f54718b1-6a37-4ef3-9983-b7afe3f948d7","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ Array.isArray($json.messages) && $json.messages.length > 0 }}","rightValue":""}]},"renameOutput":true},{"outputKey":"Daily report","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"d739f582-43b9-4947-947b-7dacdef3c0d3","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $('Every Evening at 6pm').isExecuted }}","rightValue":""}]},"renameOutput":true}]},"options":{}},"typeVersion":3.2},{"id":"4082ce23-8e97-45dc-b378-8c385a29c8b2","name":"Read Crew List from Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[720,300],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"read","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Crew"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"typeVersion":4.6,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"0db2fa80-c964-4244-917d-9c1ec097e4b4","name":"Read Project List from Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[940,300],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"read","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Projects"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":4.6,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"64a9909d-b649-4494-9f7e-76c8f6360b32","name":"Identify Sender and Project","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1160,300],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Work out who sent the message, which project it belongs to, and what kind of message it is.\nconst cfg = $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json;\nconst payload = $('When WhatsApp Message Received').first().json;\nconst msg = (payload.messages || [])[0] || {};\nconst contact = (payload.contacts || [])[0] || {};\n\nconst digits = (v) => String(v || '').replace(/\\D/g, '');\nconst norm = (s) => String(s || '').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, '');\nconst from = digits(msg.from);\n\n// Crew tab: Name | Phone | Role | Project  (phone with country code, any formatting)\nconst crew = $('Read Crew List from Sheets').all().map((i) => i.json).filter((r) => r && r.Phone);\nconst member = crew.find((r) => {\n  const p = digits(r.Phone);\n  return p.length >= 7 && from.slice(-10) === p.slice(-10);\n});\n\n// Projects tab: Project | Report emails | Active\nconst projects = $('Read Project List from Sheets').all().map((i) => i.json).filter((r) => r && r.Project);\n\nconst text = msg.type === 'text' ? ((msg.text && msg.text.body) || '') : '';\nconst caption = (msg.image && msg.image.caption) || '';\n\n// A crew member can log against another project by including #ProjectName in a text or photo caption\nlet projectName = member ? String(member.Project || '').trim() : '';\nconst tag = `${text} ${caption}`.match(/#([\\w-]+)/);\nif (tag) {\n  const hit = projects.find((p) => norm(p.Project).startsWith(norm(tag[1])));\n  if (hit) projectName = hit.Project;\n}\nconst project = projects.find((p) => norm(p.Project) === norm(projectName));\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    registered: Boolean(member),\n    from,\n    reporter: (member && member.Name) || (contact.profile && contact.profile.name) || from,\n    role: (member && member.Role) || '',\n    project: projectName || 'Unassigned',\n    reportEmails: (project && project['Report emails']) || cfg.officeEmail,\n    type: msg.type || 'unknown',\n    messageId: msg.id || '',\n    text,\n    caption,\n    mediaId: (msg.audio && msg.audio.id) || (msg.image && msg.image.id) || null,\n  },\n}];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"19c119c2-dc34-418a-bfd5-4bc9a47f5f50","name":"Check if Registered Crew Member","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1408,304],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"9cac674c-f31c-42c9-907f-c50469d31d3e","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $json.registered }}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"12819bfb-8ab4-4b4e-a561-c833c2f05447","name":"Reply: Not a Registered Number","type":"n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp","position":[1648,560],"webhookId":"d4d565ee-9aa7-4743-8c55-1fe549b5488e","parameters":{"textBody":"=Hi {{ $('Identify Sender and Project').first().json.reporter }}, this number isn't set up for site reporting yet. Please ask your project manager to add you to the crew list, then send your update again.","operation":"send","phoneNumberId":"={{ $('When WhatsApp Message Received').first().json.metadata.phone_number_id }}","additionalFields":{},"recipientPhoneNumber":"={{ $('Identify Sender and Project').first().json.from }}"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"3aa662d7-5956-473f-8f84-e5e3d9a5b98e","name":"Route by Message Type","type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","position":[1648,304],"parameters":{"rules":{"values":[{"outputKey":"Voice note","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"d6b81aac-ba55-4caf-999c-ed13a4a0d4e1","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.type }}","rightValue":"audio"}]},"renameOutput":true},{"outputKey":"Photo","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"6c2c970b-d87f-4830-8a61-29639914337b","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.type }}","rightValue":"image"}]},"renameOutput":true},{"outputKey":"Text","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"78e181cd-a406-4588-bd48-01a3edcedc78","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.type }}","rightValue":"text"}]},"renameOutput":true}]},"options":{"fallbackOutput":"extra","renameFallbackOutput":"Other"}},"typeVersion":3.2},{"id":"2f74774c-610e-4b27-bc1d-9fbe77853205","name":"Fetch Voice Note URL","type":"n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp","position":[1888,-48],"webhookId":"0cc27c8a-9124-4924-87ac-6e25194a2dc9","parameters":{"resource":"media","operation":"mediaUrlGet","mediaGetId":"={{ $json.mediaId }}"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"192cf4e1-1e9f-442a-89a5-68917a2b8cf6","name":"Download Voice Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[2096,-48],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $json.url }}","options":{"response":{"response":{"responseFormat":"file"}}},"authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","nodeCredentialType":"whatsAppApi"},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"1277d221-9d96-44a9-a16f-91ae14d8c040","name":"OpenAI Transcription","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[2320,-48],"parameters":{"options":{},"resource":"audio","operation":"transcribe"},"typeVersion":1.8},{"id":"2c9c0092-bf12-4027-ad8b-28871519fe59","name":"Fetch Photo URL","type":"n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp","position":[2128,384],"webhookId":"34c711ee-3506-40c7-9ca2-dddc111f41ff","parameters":{"resource":"media","operation":"mediaUrlGet","mediaGetId":"={{ $json.mediaId }}"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"0e10aeb6-50da-4e84-8351-f378fc4bad13","name":"Download Photo","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[2336,384],"parameters":{"url":"={{ $json.url }}","options":{"response":{"response":{"responseFormat":"file"}}},"authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","nodeCredentialType":"whatsAppApi"},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"3c3acd72-cf43-4d1c-9c94-679bad438bbd","name":"Describe Photo Using AI","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[2560,288],"parameters":{"text":"Describe this construction site photo for a daily site log in 2 to 4 factual sentences: the work stage shown, visible materials and equipment, and any visible safety hazards (missing PPE, unprotected edges, unsafe scaffolding, blocked access). Do not guess at anything you cannot see.","modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o-mini","cachedResultName":"GPT-4O-MINI"},"options":{},"resource":"image","inputType":"base64","operation":"analyze"},"typeVersion":1.8},{"id":"77092d97-6c03-484f-a768-8b4e998b897e","name":"Save Photo to Google Drive","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","onError":"continueRegularOutput","position":[2560,480],"parameters":{"name":"={{ $('Identify Sender and Project').first().json.project }}_{{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd_HH-mm') }}_{{ $('Identify Sender and Project').first().json.reporter }}.jpg","driveId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"My Drive","cachedResultName":"My Drive"},"options":{},"folderId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.photosFolderId }}"}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"871e1d37-8663-4a77-9b82-045209227100","name":"Merge Photo Descriptions","type":"n8n-nodes-base.merge","position":[2784,384],"parameters":{"mode":"combine","options":{},"combineBy":"combineByPosition"},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"27f5f743-83a9-4d01-8769-e7ed21cb518c","name":"Reply: Unsupported Message Format","type":"n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp","position":[1920,560],"webhookId":"11b16eab-86b1-4677-8df1-eee421caac14","parameters":{"textBody":"=Thanks! I can log *voice notes*, *photos* and *text* messages. Please resend your site update in one of those formats.","operation":"send","phoneNumberId":"={{ $('When WhatsApp Message Received').first().json.metadata.phone_number_id }}","additionalFields":{},"recipientPhoneNumber":"={{ $('Identify Sender and Project').first().json.from }}"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"20e9ecbd-7ca8-4d41-bf5e-dbbc8ece962c","name":"Normalize Update Into Text","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3008,304],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Turn a voice note, photo or text into one plain-text update.\nconst base = $('Identify Sender and Project').first().json;\nconst pickText = (j) => {\n  if (!j) return '';\n  const v = j.text ?? j.content ?? (j.message && j.message.content) ?? '';\n  return typeof v === 'string' ? v : JSON.stringify(v);\n};\n\nlet updateText = base.text || '';\nlet photoLink = '';\nlet photoNotes = '';\n\nif (base.type === 'audio' && $('OpenAI Transcription').isExecuted) {\n  updateText = pickText($('OpenAI Transcription').first().json);\n}\n\nif (base.type === 'image') {\n  if ($('Describe Photo Using AI').isExecuted) photoNotes = pickText($('Describe Photo Using AI').first().json);\n  if ($('Save Photo to Google Drive').isExecuted) {\n    const f = $('Save Photo to Google Drive').first().json;\n    if (f && f.id) photoLink = `https://drive.google.com/file/d/${f.id}/view`;\n  }\n  updateText = [base.caption, photoNotes ? `Photo shows: ${photoNotes}` : ''].filter(Boolean).join('\\n');\n}\n\nupdateText = String(updateText || '').trim();\nreturn [{ json: { ...base, updateText: updateText || '(empty update)', photoLink, photoNotes } }];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"aec70de6-7930-4f0b-8713-896ce472064e","name":"Extract Site Log Fields","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","position":[3248,304],"parameters":{"text":"=Project: {{ $json.project }}\nReporter: {{ $json.reporter }} ({{ $json.role || 'crew' }})\nMessage type: {{ $json.type }}\n\nMessage:\n{{ $json.updateText }}","messages":{"messageValues":[{"message":"=You turn messages from construction crews into structured daily site log entries.\n\nRULES\n- Use only what the message says. Never invent quantities, names, dates or progress.\n- Messages may be in any language, informal or transcribed from speech. Write every output field in {{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.reportLanguage }}.\n- Use 0 for numbers that are not mentioned, -1 for percent_complete when it is not mentioned, and empty arrays or empty strings for anything missing.\n- summary: one short sentence a project manager can scan.\n- category: progress, delivery, issue, safety, inspection or other.\n- safety_concern = true for any injury, near miss, missing PPE, unsafe scaffolding, fall risk, electrical or fire hazard, or any hazard described in a photo.\n- needs_attention = true when a project manager must act today: safety concerns, work stopped or blocked, missing or wrong materials, failed inspection, equipment breakdown, access problems, or a client or inspector complaint. Give a short attention_reason.\n- materials_needed: items the crew says are running low, missing or must be ordered."}]},"promptType":"define","hasOutputParser":true},"typeVersion":1.5},{"id":"600e3f47-c8f2-439d-a201-784f9722834f","name":"OpenAI Model for Extraction","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","position":[3408,528],"parameters":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o-mini","cachedResultName":"gpt-4o-mini"},"options":{"temperature":0.1}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"edb7b0a2-9033-43a5-afea-402dae291c50","name":"Site Log Output Format Parser","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured","position":[3584,528],"parameters":{"schemaType":"manual","inputSchema":"{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"category\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"progress\",\n        \"delivery\",\n        \"issue\",\n        \"safety\",\n        \"inspection\",\n        \"other\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"work_completed\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"crew_on_site\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"hours_worked\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"materials_used\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"materials_needed\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"issues\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"safety_concern\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"needs_attention\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"attention_reason\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"percent_complete\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\"\n    },\n    \"weather\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"summary\",\n    \"category\",\n    \"work_completed\",\n    \"crew_on_site\",\n    \"hours_worked\",\n    \"materials_used\",\n    \"materials_needed\",\n    \"issues\",\n    \"safety_concern\",\n    \"needs_attention\",\n    \"attention_reason\",\n    \"percent_complete\",\n    \"weather\"\n  ]\n}"},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"0e53eac9-582f-44bf-ab78-f381f578ad5b","name":"Build Log Row Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3520,304],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Flatten the AI extraction into one Google Sheets row.\nconst u = $('Normalize Update Into Text').first().json;\nconst ai = $input.first().json.output || $input.first().json;\nconst list = (a) => (Array.isArray(a) ? a.filter(Boolean).join('; ') : String(a || ''));\nconst num = (v) => (Number.isFinite(Number(v)) && Number(v) >= 0 ? Number(v) : '');\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    Date: $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd'),\n    Time: $now.toFormat('HH:mm'),\n    Project: u.project,\n    Reporter: u.reporter,\n    Role: u.role,\n    Phone: u.from,\n    Type: u.type === 'audio' ? 'Voice note' : u.type === 'image' ? 'Photo' : 'Text',\n    Category: ai.category || 'other',\n    Summary: ai.summary || '',\n    'Work completed': list(ai.work_completed),\n    'Crew on site': num(ai.crew_on_site),\n    Hours: num(ai.hours_worked),\n    'Materials used': list(ai.materials_used),\n    'Materials needed': list(ai.materials_needed),\n    Issues: list(ai.issues),\n    'Safety concern': ai.safety_concern ? 'Yes' : 'No',\n    'Needs attention': ai.needs_attention ? 'Yes' : 'No',\n    'Attention reason': ai.attention_reason || '',\n    'Percent complete': num(ai.percent_complete),\n    Weather: ai.weather || '',\n    'Photo link': u.photoLink || '',\n    'Original message': String(u.updateText).slice(0, 2000),\n    'Message ID': u.messageId,\n  },\n}];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"ee79ca6a-96f6-4778-8a1d-1e87e3573846","name":"Append to Site Log Sheet","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[3760,304],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":[]},"options":{"cellFormat":"RAW"},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Site log"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"typeVersion":4.6},{"id":"69c952e5-ed30-49eb-9f49-4aa4277dd3b9","name":"Confirm Receipt to Crew","type":"n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp","position":[4016,176],"webhookId":"aeb533ac-b7a0-4194-860d-ca48ac8439e6","parameters":{"textBody":"=✅ Logged for *{{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json.Project }}*\n{{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json.Summary }}{{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json['Needs attention'] === 'Yes' ? '\\n\\n⚠️ Flagged to your project manager: ' + $('Build Log Row Data').first().json['Attention reason'] : '' }}{{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json.Project === 'Unassigned' ? '\\n\\nTip: add #ProjectName to your message so it is filed under the right job.' : '' }}","operation":"send","phoneNumberId":"={{ $('When WhatsApp Message Received').first().json.metadata.phone_number_id }}","additionalFields":{},"recipientPhoneNumber":"={{ $('Identify Sender and Project').first().json.from }}"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"7bed117e-b7df-4725-913d-8f2bb4830436","name":"Check PM Attention Needed","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[4016,416],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"3d5ef3be-e354-4c82-af2f-81c74d8f3d32","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json['Needs attention'] }}","rightValue":"Yes"}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"bd1df012-14c7-4936-81f3-b54153c83d8f","name":"Send PM Alert Email","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[4240,416],"webhookId":"26c81d8a-e689-482e-8956-dd43c5a2c1bc","parameters":{"sendTo":"={{ $('Normalize Update Into Text').first().json.reportEmails }}","message":"=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:620px\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">{{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json['Safety concern'] === 'Yes' ? 'Safety concern' : 'Action needed' }} on {{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json.Project }}</h2><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><strong>{{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json['Attention reason'] }}</strong></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;color:#6b7280\">Reported by {{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json.Reporter }} at {{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json.Time }} via WhatsApp {{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json.Type.toLowerCase() }}</p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 4px\"><strong>Summary:</strong> {{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json.Summary }}</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><strong>Issues:</strong> {{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json.Issues || 'None listed' }}</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><strong>Materials needed:</strong> {{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json['Materials needed'] || 'None listed' }}</p>{{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json['Photo link'] ? '<p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><a href=\"' + $('Build Log Row Data').first().json['Photo link'] + '\">View site photo</a></p>' : '' }}<p style=\"margin:12px 0 4px;color:#6b7280\">Original message:</p><blockquote style=\"margin:0;padding:8px 12px;border-left:3px solid #e5e7eb;color:#374151\">{{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json['Original message'].replace(/</g, '&lt;') }}</blockquote></div>","options":{},"subject":"=⚠️ {{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json.Project }}: {{ $('Build Log Row Data').first().json['Attention reason'] || $('Build Log Row Data').first().json.Summary }}","emailType":"html","operation":"send"},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"d6991fac-1f76-4f9c-87de-b899b9cc8568","name":"Read Site Log for Today","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[720,1400],"parameters":{"options":{},"filtersUI":{"values":[{"lookupValue":"={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}","lookupColumn":"Date"}]},"operation":"read","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Site log"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"typeVersion":4.6,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"c48b765c-49c3-40f4-b232-252982044a7d","name":"Read Projects for Reports","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[940,1400],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"read","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Projects"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":4.6,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"5ea9e080-da46-483d-9b9f-8971516f3d07","name":"Group Updates by Project","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1160,1400],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Group today's site log rows by project and add deterministic totals.\nconst cfg = $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json;\nconst today = $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd');\nconst norm = (s) => String(s || '').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, '');\nconst split = (s) => String(s || '').split(';').map((x) => x.trim()).filter(Boolean);\nconst uniq = (a) => [...new Set(a)];\n\nconst rows = $('Read Site Log for Today').all().map((i) => i.json)\n  .filter((r) => r && r.Project && String(r.Date).slice(0, 10) === today);\n\nconst projects = $('Read Projects for Reports').all().map((i) => i.json)\n  .filter((p) => p && p.Project && !['no', 'false', 'inactive'].includes(String(p.Active || 'yes').trim().toLowerCase()));\n\n// Include any project that sent updates today even if it is missing from the Projects tab\nconst names = uniq([...projects.map((p) => p.Project), ...rows.map((r) => r.Project)]);\n\nreturn names.map((name) => {\n  const p = projects.find((x) => norm(x.Project) === norm(name));\n  const updates = rows.filter((r) => norm(r.Project) === norm(name));\n  const n = (v) => (Number.isFinite(Number(v)) && String(v).trim() !== '' ? Number(v) : null);\n  const crew = updates.map((r) => n(r['Crew on site'])).filter((v) => v !== null);\n  const hours = updates.map((r) => n(r.Hours)).filter((v) => v !== null);\n  const pct = updates.map((r) => n(r['Percent complete'])).filter((v) => v !== null);\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      project: name,\n      date: today,\n      to: (p && p['Report emails']) || cfg.officeEmail,\n      hasUpdates: updates.length > 0,\n      updateCount: updates.length,\n      reporters: uniq(updates.map((r) => r.Reporter).filter(Boolean)),\n      crewOnSite: crew.length ? Math.max(...crew) : null,\n      hoursLogged: hours.length ? hours.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) : null,\n      percentComplete: pct.length ? pct[pct.length - 1] : null,\n      safetyFlags: updates.filter((r) => r['Safety concern'] === 'Yes').length,\n      attentionItems: updates.filter((r) => r['Needs attention'] === 'Yes').map((r) => r['Attention reason'] || r.Summary),\n      materialsNeeded: uniq(updates.flatMap((r) => split(r['Materials needed']))),\n      photos: updates.map((r) => r['Photo link']).filter(Boolean),\n      updates: updates.map((r) => ({\n        time: r.Time,\n        reporter: r.Reporter,\n        type: r.Type,\n        summary: r.Summary,\n        work: r['Work completed'],\n        issues: r.Issues,\n        materialsNeeded: r['Materials needed'],\n        weather: r.Weather,\n      })),\n    },\n  };\n});\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"8f94c9a0-0e77-437b-811c-ede509739757","name":"Check for Todays Updates","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1380,1400],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"e575d720-33eb-44d4-bc26-e1c4217ca55c","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $json.hasUpdates }}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"e1481d08-b8b9-450d-b9f4-9a8665b527cf","name":"Compile Daily Report","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","position":[1680,1264],"parameters":{"text":"=Write today's report for {{ $json.project }} ({{ $json.date }}).\n\nTotals and updates:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json, null, 2) }}","messages":{"messageValues":[{"message":"=You are an assistant project manager writing the end-of-day site report for a construction project.\n\nRULES\n- Use only the updates provided. Never invent progress, quantities, people or dates.\n- Write in {{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.reportLanguage }}, in plain, professional language a client could read.\n- headline: one sentence on the most important thing that happened today.\n- overall_status: \"blocked\" if work stopped or cannot continue, \"at_risk\" if there are safety concerns, delays, missing materials or failed inspections, otherwise \"on_track\".\n- progress_summary: 2 to 4 sentences.\n- work_completed, issues_and_risks, materials_to_order: short bullet-style items, merged and de-duplicated across all updates.\n- next_steps: what the crew or the project manager should do next, based only on the updates."}]},"promptType":"define","hasOutputParser":true},"typeVersion":1.5},{"id":"9ea191e2-c3b1-4d67-8191-3005c7457830","name":"OpenAI Model for Reports","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","position":[1648,1488],"parameters":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o-mini","cachedResultName":"gpt-4o-mini"},"options":{"temperature":0.1}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"fe0deb3b-1b7b-4633-bc88-9303f12cbaf4","name":"Daily Report Format Parser","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured","position":[1824,1488],"parameters":{"schemaType":"manual","inputSchema":"{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"headline\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"overall_status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"on_track\",\n        \"at_risk\",\n        \"blocked\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"progress_summary\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"work_completed\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"issues_and_risks\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"materials_to_order\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"next_steps\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"headline\",\n    \"overall_status\",\n    \"progress_summary\",\n    \"work_completed\",\n    \"issues_and_risks\",\n    \"materials_to_order\",\n    \"next_steps\"\n  ]\n}"},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"4ca55d30-806b-4b64-b7ed-ced8be059cb7","name":"Construct Report Email","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2000,1264],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Build a clean HTML email for each project report.\nconst cfg = $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json;\nconst source = $('Check for Todays Updates').all(0);\nconst esc = (s) => String(s ?? '').replace(/[&<>\"']/g, (c) => ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '\"': '&quot;', \"'\": '&#39;' }[c]));\nconst ul = (arr) => (arr && arr.length ? `<ul style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px;padding:0\">${arr.map((x) => `<li style=\"margin:3px 0\">${esc(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>` : '<p style=\"margin:6px 0;color:#6b7280\">None reported</p>');\nconst STATUS = {\n  on_track: { label: 'On track', bg: '#dcfce7', fg: '#166534' },\n  at_risk: { label: 'At risk', bg: '#fef9c3', fg: '#854d0e' },\n  blocked: { label: 'Blocked', bg: '#fee2e2', fg: '#991b1b' },\n};\n\nreturn $input.all().map((item, i) => {\n  const ai = item.json.output || item.json;\n  const d = (source[i] && source[i].json) || {};\n  const st = STATUS[ai.overall_status] || STATUS.on_track;\n  const kpi = (label, value) => `<td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:center\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700\">${value ?? '–'}</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#6b7280\">${label}</div></td>`;\n  const timeline = (d.updates || []).map((u) => `<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;white-space:nowrap\">${esc(u.time)}</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6\">${esc(u.reporter)}</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6\">${esc(u.type)}</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6\">${esc(u.summary)}</td></tr>`).join('');\n  const photos = (d.photos || []).map((p, n) => `<a href=\"${esc(p)}\" style=\"margin-right:10px\">Photo ${n + 1}</a>`).join('');\n\n  const html = `\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#111827\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0;color:#6b7280;font-size:13px\">${esc(cfg.companyName)} · Daily site report · ${esc(d.date)}</p>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:6px 0 4px\">${esc(d.project)}</h2>\n  <span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;background:${st.bg};color:${st.fg};font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">${st.label}</span>\n  <p style=\"font-size:15px;margin:14px 0\"><strong>${esc(ai.headline)}</strong></p>\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:8px 0 16px\"><tr>\n    ${kpi('Updates', d.updateCount)}${kpi('Crew on site', d.crewOnSite)}${kpi('Hours logged', d.hoursLogged)}${kpi('% complete', d.percentComplete !== null && d.percentComplete !== undefined ? d.percentComplete + '%' : null)}${kpi('Safety flags', d.safetyFlags)}\n  </tr></table>\n  <h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 4px;font-size:15px\">Progress</h3><p style=\"margin:6px 0\">${esc(ai.progress_summary)}</p>\n  <h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 4px;font-size:15px\">Work completed</h3>${ul(ai.work_completed)}\n  <h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 4px;font-size:15px\">Issues and risks</h3>${ul(ai.issues_and_risks)}\n  <h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 4px;font-size:15px\">Materials to order</h3>${ul(ai.materials_to_order)}\n  <h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 4px;font-size:15px\">Next steps</h3>${ul(ai.next_steps)}\n  ${photos ? `<h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 4px;font-size:15px\">Site photos</h3><p>${photos}</p>` : ''}\n  <h3 style=\"margin:16px 0 4px;font-size:15px\">Updates from site</h3>\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px\">\n    <tr style=\"background:#f9fafb\"><th style=\"padding:6px;text-align:left\">Time</th><th style=\"padding:6px;text-align:left\">From</th><th style=\"padding:6px;text-align:left\">Type</th><th style=\"padding:6px;text-align:left\">Summary</th></tr>\n    ${timeline}\n  </table>\n  <p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;margin-top:20px\">Generated automatically from WhatsApp site updates. Reporters today: ${esc((d.reporters || []).join(', '))}.</p>\n</div>`;\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      to: d.to,\n      subject: `${st.label === 'On track' ? '' : '[' + st.label + '] '}${d.project}: daily site report ${d.date}`,\n      html,\n      project: d.project,\n      date: d.date,\n      status: st.label,\n      headline: ai.headline || '',\n      updateCount: d.updateCount,\n      crewOnSite: d.crewOnSite,\n      hoursLogged: d.hoursLogged,\n      issues: (ai.issues_and_risks || []).join('; '),\n    },\n  };\n});\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"f044b045-c3a5-49a8-a15e-d57d4a05de92","name":"Create No-Update Notice","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2000,1568],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Projects that sent nothing today get a short \"no report received\" notice.\nconst cfg = $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json;\nconst esc = (s) => String(s ?? '').replace(/[&<>\"']/g, (c) => ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '\"': '&quot;', \"'\": '&#39;' }[c]));\n\nreturn $input.all().map((item) => {\n  const d = item.json;\n  const html = `\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#111827\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0;color:#6b7280;font-size:13px\">${esc(cfg.companyName)} · Daily site report · ${esc(d.date)}</p>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:6px 0 4px\">${esc(d.project)}</h2>\n  <span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;background:#f3f4f6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">No update received</span>\n  <p style=\"margin:14px 0\">No WhatsApp updates were received from this site today. Check in with the site lead, or mark the project inactive in the Projects tab if work is paused.</p>\n</div>`;\n  return {\n    json: {\n      to: d.to,\n      subject: `[No update] ${d.project}: daily site report ${d.date}`,\n      html,\n      project: d.project,\n      date: d.date,\n      status: 'No update received',\n      headline: 'No site updates received today',\n      updateCount: 0,\n      crewOnSite: null,\n      hoursLogged: null,\n      issues: '',\n    },\n  };\n});\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"f7fa3bdd-00d3-4bae-8674-8d8a6eddd4bb","name":"Send Daily Report Email","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[2240,1300],"webhookId":"1f38b807-704a-4e80-b127-954884142733","parameters":{"sendTo":"={{ $json.to }}","message":"={{ $json.html }}","options":{},"subject":"={{ $json.subject }}","emailType":"html","operation":"send"},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"a3d4cddb-12ee-4967-8473-7667e720f477","name":"Format Report Row","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[2240,1540],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"1bbeb61e-2514-4b42-afab-1ff2abb74d1f","name":"Date","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.date }}"},{"id":"bb5c4bec-0257-454f-adb8-aa5d2372487a","name":"Project","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.project }}"},{"id":"125a6f50-e2fc-4851-a3d5-968ab5724a95","name":"Status","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.status }}"},{"id":"f2c87743-ee2c-4124-a236-75fd5c443c9a","name":"Headline","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.headline }}"},{"id":"5bf1e648-ac37-4e7f-a545-385fe73b281d","name":"Updates","type":"number","value":"={{ $json.updateCount }}"},{"id":"6c01a8e2-a954-4051-bb74-d0b822bcaac2","name":"Crew on site","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.crewOnSite ?? '' }}"},{"id":"5b2f7d8a-c816-4309-8b78-5adee73bda46","name":"Hours logged","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.hoursLogged ?? '' }}"},{"id":"b5e9225a-4cc7-4926-a7c8-9587e80f8e1a","name":"Issues","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.issues }}"},{"id":"fb3824d4-6edb-429f-9b5a-6d08f379a36d","name":"Sent to","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.to }}"}]}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"bc8f7dcf-43c6-4c57-9ff7-066d1f1c3c0f","name":"Append to Daily Reports Sheet","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[2460,1540],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":[]},"options":{"cellFormat":"RAW"},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Daily reports"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"url","value":"={{ $('Set Configuration Parameters').first().json.sheetUrl }}"}},"typeVersion":4.6}],"pinData":{},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1"},"connections":{"Download Photo":{"main":[[{"node":"Describe Photo Using AI","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Save Photo to Google Drive","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Fetch Photo URL":{"main":[[{"node":"Download Photo","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Format Report Row":{"main":[[{"node":"Append to Daily Reports Sheet","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Build Log Row Data":{"main":[[{"node":"Append to Site Log Sheet","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Download Voice Note":{"main":[[{"node":"OpenAI Transcription","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Compile Daily Report":{"main":[[{"node":"Construct Report Email","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Every Evening at 6pm":{"main":[[{"node":"Set Configuration Parameters","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Fetch Voice Note URL":{"main":[[{"node":"Download Voice Note","type":"main","index":0}]]},"OpenAI Transcription":{"main":[[{"node":"Normalize Update Into Text","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Route by Message Type":{"main":[[{"node":"Fetch Voice Note URL","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Fetch Photo URL","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Normalize Update Into Text","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Reply: Unsupported Message Format","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Construct Report Email":{"main":[[{"node":"Send Daily Report Email","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Format Report Row","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Route by Trigger Event":{"main":[[{"node":"Read Crew List from Sheets","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Read Site Log for Today","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Create No-Update Notice":{"main":[[{"node":"Send Daily Report Email","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Format Report Row","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Describe Photo Using AI":{"main":[[{"node":"Merge Photo Descriptions","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Extract Site Log Fields":{"main":[[{"node":"Build Log Row Data","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Read Site Log for Today":{"main":[[{"node":"Read Projects for Reports","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Append to Site Log Sheet":{"main":[[{"node":"Confirm Receipt to Crew","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Check PM Attention Needed","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Check for Todays Updates":{"main":[[{"node":"Compile Daily Report","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Create No-Update Notice","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Group Updates by Project":{"main":[[{"node":"Check for Todays Updates","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Merge Photo Descriptions":{"main":[[{"node":"Normalize Update Into Text","type":"main","index":0}]]},"OpenAI Model for Reports":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Compile Daily Report","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"Check PM Attention Needed":{"main":[[{"node":"Send PM Alert Email","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Read Projects for Reports":{"main":[[{"node":"Group Updates by Project","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Daily Report Format Parser":{"ai_outputParser":[[{"node":"Compile Daily Report","type":"ai_outputParser","index":0}]]},"Normalize Update Into Text":{"main":[[{"node":"Extract Site Log Fields","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Read Crew List from Sheets":{"main":[[{"node":"Read Project List from Sheets","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Save Photo to Google Drive":{"main":[[{"node":"Merge Photo Descriptions","type":"main","index":1}]]},"Identify Sender and Project":{"main":[[{"node":"Check if Registered Crew Member","type":"main","index":0}]]},"OpenAI Model for Extraction":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Extract Site Log Fields","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"Set Configuration Parameters":{"main":[[{"node":"Route by Trigger Event","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Read Project List from Sheets":{"main":[[{"node":"Identify Sender and Project","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Site Log Output Format Parser":{"ai_outputParser":[[{"node":"Extract Site Log Fields","type":"ai_outputParser","index":0}]]},"When WhatsApp Message Received":{"main":[[{"node":"Set Configuration Parameters","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Check if Registered Crew Member":{"main":[[{"node":"Route by Message Type","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Reply: Not a Registered Number","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}